-// PF28: pf_gdl with 8 lanes a row (16 values each, float4 s + 8 i), 4 rows a warp. S_old.k, S_old.q
-// and k.q in one 3-level butterfly; y = decay S.q + delta k.q is S_new.q (fast-tier rounding).
